# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}
# R8 + `optimization.packageScope` (kotlin.**): R8 repackaged Kotlin multi-file facade parts
# (e.g. kotlin.text.StringsKt__StringBuilderKt) out of their package while their superclass part stays
# package-private, so release crashed at startup with IllegalAccessError (found by the E16 benchmarks,
# see docs/PERFORMANCE.md). Keep the part classes' names/packages; they can still be optimized/shrunk.
-keep,allowshrinking,allowoptimization class kotlin.**Kt__**
